[en.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_TARTARUS]
March to Tartarus

[en.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_TARTARUS_desc]
We have deployed our army to the gate of Tartarus through various excuses. Next, we will launch a surprise invasion to take down Tartarus before the Equestria Empire reacts!

[zh.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_TARTARUS]
进军塔尔塔洛斯

[zh.FOCUS_C11_INVADE_TARTARUS_desc]
我们已经通过各种借口，将军队部署到了塔尔塔洛斯门口，接下来，发起突袭战争，在小马利亚帝国有所反应之前拿下塔尔塔洛斯！

